  "summary": "Forestar Group Inc. today announced that it is proposing to sell $500 million aggregate principal amount of senior unsecured notes due 2033. The Notes will be offered and sold in a private placement to qualified institutional buyers pursuant to Rule 144 A under the Securities Act of 1933, as amended, and to non- U.S.",
